WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.400
From the forest of the spirit tree.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.230
Even kids.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.790
Who is that giant man?

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.200
We have become an exhibition.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.480
They're just jealous.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:10.730
Look!

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:11.990
Elves!

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.260
They have otherworldly beings 
like elves with them.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:17.010
Then, are they real witches?

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.230
How rude!

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:18.420
No kidding.

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.460
They lumped me in with you!

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:23.000
So one of those two must be...

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.820
No... Hey, folks.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.400
The lady witch is this one here.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.380
Why are you hiding?

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.560
Hello.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.590
What the hell?

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.380
No way. She's just a girl.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.530
Morgan, is this some joke?

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.560
Uh, no. It's no joke.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.510
Uh-oh...

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:39.130
Well, not like I blame them.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.950
Why not show them a spell or two?

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:43.940
Maybe that'll convince them.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.460
That's impossible!

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.480
You don't use magic to show off.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.650
That's unthinkable.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.530
That is why I objected to this, elder.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.070
Reverend!

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:53.830
A pastor.

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:56.280
This is becoming too complicated...

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.640
Clinging to strange superstitions,

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.790
such as witches, will not solve anything.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.630
Still, Morgan...

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.590
How could you make a 
child dress as a witch?

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:11.980
I'm sure you feel guilt over 
being the sole survivor,

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.580
but this goes too far.

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:14.800
No...

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.690
Your garments suggest you 
are a traveling troupe.

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:21.310
Did Morgan beg for help 
when you were traveling?

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.400
I don't know if this is 
a diversion to you,

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:28.000
but you cannot handle 
those demonic beasts.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.310
Leave now.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:33.470
But if you take a good look, reverend,

00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:35.500
the giant man appears quite formidable.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.850
Why do we have to chase them off?

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:37.700
I insist!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.860
This ordeal is a test of 
our faith, sent by God.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:42.830
We must pray and endure.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.570
Let's just go back already. 
They can figure it out.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:48.570
Hey, so we came here, only to 
be turned away at the door?

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:49.830
It's starting to feel stupid.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:52.570
Girl, while you may think it a costume,

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:54.760
you must not dress that way.

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:57.590
If this were the Holy See, 
you'd be burned at the stake.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:01.850
Witches symbolize nothing 
but sin and evil.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.060
We're exhausted from traveling a 
long way with kids and the ill.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.230
Can we lodge here tonight?

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:08.310
No!

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.550
We have far more important things to—

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:11.860
This girl is on a pilgrimage to pray 
for recovery from illness.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:15.610
As a man of the cloth, aren't you 
obligated to provide for pilgrims?

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.860
I take no responsibility for what happens.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.610
We're in your debt.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:22.180
Look at that sword...

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.410
Is it real?

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.870
Look at his left arm.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.370
Elder, find lodgings for them.

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:29.570
That was clever.

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:31.480
Well, I'm hungry.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:34.140
Use your eyes and decide for yourself

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:37.760
what this fateful encounter 
means for you.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:43.130
<b><i>Fight for Survival Against 
the Demonic Legion</i></b>

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.020
Everyone, please tie this on a finger.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:15.180
Hair? Is it yours?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.730
Why?

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.840
So I can mindspeak with everyone.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.090
She means telepathy.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.400
Mindspeak? Sounds like a hoax.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.900
<i>Stupid monkey.</i>

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.530
Who you calling "monkey," bitch?!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:29.060
This is an application 
of contagious magic,

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:32.420
which employs a part 
of the caster's body.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:35.290
A little like using bits of nail or 
hair cuttings for a curse?

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.590
To some degree,

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:39.840
anyone can use the mind for direct 
communication with another.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:42.430
But it requires connecting one's od...

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:44.910
one's spiritual magnetic 
force with the other's.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:48.110
I'm only connected to you? 
And the rest?

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:51.430
Connecting two who haven't trained 
at all would be impossible.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.210
So...

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.060
When we deal with the trolls,

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.940
I need you all to follow my instructions.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.450
Obviously.

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.570
What the hell?! No way!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.720
Who's gonna listen to 
a little girl like you?

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.750
It is the most logical approach.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:10.240
As the sole mage, only I can 
monitor the operation

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.170
and communicate with you.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.130
That is true.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:17.670
When it comes to trolls, 
you're the specialist.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.550
Well, why not?

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.500
This is her mission, anyway.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.260
Salute the commander, private!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.830
Damn it to hell!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.890
If you flee before the enemy, you'll be 
shot for desertion, Private Monkey!

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.480
Who're you calling "monkey"?

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.270
Honestly...

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:31.260
What is wrong with him?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.610
He wanted to be in charge.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:40.000
Damn it!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.590
Boy, are you practicing the sword?

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.940
Being alone is dangerous.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.360
And what're you up to?

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:52.200
I'd thought to catch you all some 
fish for supper, but no luck.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.250
Well, I hope potato soup will do.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:58.730
I've gotta say, this village 
is kinda crummy.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.180
This deep in the valley,

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:02.940
you get a half-day's worth 
of sun, at best.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.750
Back in my grandfather's time,

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:10.560
the village did pretty well as a resting 
point along a major route.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.920
But that time is past.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:17.150
Still, we shouldn't just 
go quietly, you know?

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.390
I have faith in you all.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:24.080
Boy, why are you traveling with them?

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.900
Is it because you serve 
the black swordsman?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.200
No!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.530
I'm traveling to hone my battle skills!

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:34.890
Guts and I have a contract that 
he'll teach me swordsmanship.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:35.730
Oh?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:41.040
That swordsman is very strong, 
swinging that giant sword.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.010
Right?

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:44.840
He isn't just strong. He's a monster!

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.060
You look up to him, huh?

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.570
Look up to him? No, thanks!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.910
I'm using him, see?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:55.350
Well, I'm okay with saying 
he's my goal... for now.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:56.510
I see.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.850
Do you have any family?

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.640
Heh, who cares about that?

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.650
It's none of your business.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.370
And what about you?

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:11.130
I bet your family isn't too keen 
on your going to find a witch.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.050
Besides, what's up with the villagers?

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:19.150
After you risked your neck fetching 
a witch, even a half-baked one,

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:21.210
they treat you like some liar!

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.270
What a heartless bunch.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:24.860
Why don't you just leave?

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:28.170
What's the point of sticking 
around this hole in the ground?

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:32.220
My family's bones rest here.

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.250
Trolls get them?

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:37.260
No, it was before all that. 
There was famine.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:43.760
I'm grateful that the villagers trusted 
the fate of this place to me.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.420
I don't hate them.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:48.400
Actually, I'm rather grateful.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.760
I was able to see her one last 
time before my death.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.900
I think all men are the same.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:59.370
As a boy, you love to 
imagine adventures.

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:04.830
I'd neglect my chores to go to 
the mountains and forests,

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.650
trying to find witches and catch elves.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:12.070
Like you said, I dreamed of leaving this 
small village behind someday,

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:16.140
and going to make my fortune on 
the wide sea beyond Vritannis.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.690
That is...

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:22.690
until my mother fell ill.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.440
I don't really remember much 
about those times,

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:31.390
but I found myself wandering 
the depths of the forest.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:36.200
To find a cure for my mother, 
I must've sought out the witch.

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:41.420
I reached her mansion in 
a dream-like trance.

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:47.160
The medicine I brought back 
saved my mother's life.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:50.890
But she had aged immensely.

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:53.970
That's when I began to 
help with chores

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.680
and stopped going to the forest.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.360
And now, I'm old.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:05.110
With the passage of time, 
my memories have grown fuzzy.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:08.290
Did everything really happen?

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:14.560
But back there, deep in the forest, 
she was still waiting for me.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:16.700
Still looking exactly the same.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.660
That is enough for me.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:21.800
Just stop!

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:25.180
I don't need stories of has-beens 
when I'm just starting my life!

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:27.080
Kids these days.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:31.300
You clung to a fairy tale dream, 
and one day, you woke up old!

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:34.670
I'm pursuing my dream! 
I'm not like you!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.510
Listening's gonna kill my ambition.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.260
Later!

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:42.390
Oh, you were listening?

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:46.530
That boy seems to hold 
you in high regard.

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:53.220
<i>When the trolls attack, the villagers 
will seek shelter at this church.</i>

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.540
<i>We have no choice but to set 
a defense around this place.</i>

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.840
<i>I have to keep it together.</i>

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:03.390
<i>But there is something 
else about this place...</i>

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.790
What?

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:10.040
Get out, witch.

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.250
The reverend says witches 
and trolls are the same!

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:22.390
Scoping out the battlefield?

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.900
Sounds about right.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:28.520
Didn't you have things you 
wanted to tell that pastor?

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.350
I hate him, that fox-eyes.

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:33.560
It isn't just the pastor.

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:37.590
I think everyone in the 
physical realm is wrong.

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.880
The hill on which the church stands...

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:43.410
Once, a temple to the spirits 
of this land was here.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.010
To stamp spirits out of existence,

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:48.660
the Holy See built many churches

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.420
on places sacred to those 
who revered spirits.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.400
Their doctrine has become

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.920
naught but a tool to demonstrate 
their authority.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:02.680
People fight in God's name and 
pray for salvation in God's name,

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:06.900
but the key to their salvation may lie

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:10.580
in the very entities they choose to forget.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:15.730
That includes you witches, huh?

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:21.180
My mistress used to live 
around these parts.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:26.290
I heard she visited the poor villages, 
delivering messages from spirits,

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.800
notifying people of weather changes, 
and healing the sick.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:35.040
Her magic saved countless lives.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:39.870
But once the Holy See's influence 
spread to this region

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:42.280
and they began building churches here,

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:48.880
the people turned on her and 
chased her into the forest.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.860
Ever since then,

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:55.820
she's lived in the forest, as though 
in hiding, away from human eyes.

00:11:56.830 --> 00:12:00.070
But now, they seek her help, 
as if nothing had happened.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.620
I can't forgive what they've done.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:06.080
If it weren't because of my mistress, 
who'd bother helping this village?

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:08.080
Then don't.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.550
If you don't feel up to it,

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:16.230
there's no need to risk your life 
for that ungrateful bunch.

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:20.400
Besides, that lady won't live long, 
so all the more reason not to.

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:24.970
Doing something you don't want to, 
just because you're told to, is weak.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.260
<i>How rude and irresponsible!</i>

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:32.890
<i>I brought you here against my will...</i>

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.360
<i>He can't be part of my destiny! Never!</i>

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.110
Come on, hold still.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.260
Lady Farnese, since she can't talk,

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:45.920
is there any point in tying hair to her?

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:48.750
But Schierke said we should, regardless.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.150
Apparently, images can 
be communicated.

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:52.370
But I don't really understand.

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:54.870
Stay still.

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:57.520
<i>To be honest, I think 
this troll mission...</i>

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.220
<i>rather, this entire journey</i>

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:03.880
<i>should have been stopped 
in the first place, but...</i>

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.630
Oh, come now.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:07.650
Casca!

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.430
All right, now it's fine

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.140
<i>It's changed her...</i>

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.730
<i>Something I wasn't able to do.</i>

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:23.530
<i>I suppose this smile makes 
it worth the trouble.</i>

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.620
We match.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.240
<i>Spirits of the air.</i>

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:31.910
<i>Bound by nothing, they go 
where they wish.</i>

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:34.930
<i>How ironic.</i>

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:38.420
<i>I am so unlike them.</i>

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.260
What's wrong?

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:46.680
Here they come.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:51.090
<i>The trolls are here. To the church!</i>

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.600
What was that? Could it be...

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.430
It's telepathy.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.070
Serpico!

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:57.260
Lady Farnese!

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:06.700
Hey!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:12.170
Trolls! But why so many?!

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:14.090
They mean to overwhelm 
and devour us.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:16.210
We need to run! We aren't safe here!

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.760
First, blow the horn!

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:18.460
Right.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:24.960
Hey!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.700
I just got that mindspeak thing.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:28.770
It sure is useful.

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:30.490
We should head for the church.

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.340
No!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:34.790
Huh?

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.340
Serpico, remember what 
Schierke said!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.530
Elementals!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:38.530
Pull yourself together!

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:39.640
Right.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:42.540
<i>Uh, so visualize...</i>

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:47.530
I'm counting on you, spirits!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:57.790
Hurry!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.120
Thank you!

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:06.420
Got it!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.970
They're actually very helpful.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:09.890
Magic...

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:11.180
It's real magic!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:12.680
Damn it!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.890
Why do you always get to show off?

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:16.860
This one's mine!

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:18.250
Go, fire!

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:20.810
One's enough!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:22.420
Get away!

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.230
Oh, it works.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.070
Run, or you'll be eaten!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.470
This is pointless!

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.320
Agreed!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:36.830
Shit!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.190
They're eating their own injured!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:41.530
If you don't want to end 
up like that troll, run!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:44.220
Casca!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.270
Are you all right?

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.590
Y-Yes...

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.960
<i>I never would have thought</i>

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:58.430
<i>that Lady Farnese would shield 
anyone with her body.</i>

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:03.240
It looks like the silver's warding off evil.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:05.030
I'll clear a path.

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.570
Run to the church.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.320
Everyone, hurry inside.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.100
Look!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.320
Someone's surrounded!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.430
They're the witch's companions.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:14.600
They stopped so I could escape!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.680
There's no hope for them now.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.260
<i>Fools.</i>

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:19.830
<i>I warned them.</i>

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:21.650
Fool!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.830
They can't be dealt with 
by human means!

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:56.680
Now's our chance!

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.740
Run to the church!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:01.330
Reverend, did you see that?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.270
Amazing.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.210
He did it!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.580
That man might take back 
the village from the trolls.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.190
Wow, he's amazing!

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:09.540
You can't tell who the monster is here.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.840
<i>Indeed, he seems hardly human.</i>

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.020
<i>Is this also because</i>

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:17.820
<i>he long resided in the interstice, 
where mind easily influences matter?</i>

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:19.330
<i>Or something else?</i>

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:22.850
<i>What are the shadows I 
see around his blade?</i>

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:24.860
Ready, Ivalera?

00:17:24.860 --> 00:17:26.020
I was born ready.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.360
I put the charm on a wall facing 
the direction you said.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:31.110
<i>Look at her, all nervous.</i>

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.800
Er, hello!

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:36.360
I'll use magic to erect a shield 
around the church.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.240
Everyone should go inside.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:40.800
Accursed witch!

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:43.590
Elder, please drag her down right now.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.060
Oh, but...

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.440
Magic? No way...

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:50.930
I saw her companions rip trolls 
apart without touching them!

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:53.260
Isn't she with the swordsman? If so...

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.440
There!

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.010
Yep, baby steps...

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:03.020
Stop it!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:04.820
Hey, wait a minute!

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:05.150
No, I forbid it!

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.900
We're busy. Don't interfere.

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:07.770
How dare you perform such 
evil acts before God?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:09.700
Step down at once.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.440
Who do you think Schierke
is trying to help, anyway?

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.690
I said to stop!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:16.860
You're the one who needs to stop!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.940
She is trying to protect the village!

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:21.200
You cannot see that?

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.330
Silence!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.050
Even if we were to survive,

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:28.510
if we did so by an evil force, 
it would have no meaning!

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:30.210
God ordained our deaths!

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:33.590
<i>This man... is the same.</i>

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.260
<i>The same as I was before,</i>

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.760
<i>damning people to their 
deaths in God's name.</i>

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.200
<i>I have no right to speak.</i>

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.730
So words will not reach you?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.360
Stop him!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:57.740
When Schierke's chanting, she has 
no sense of what's going on!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:59.540
Let go of her!

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:00.660
Do not interfere!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.030
What's going on?

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:17.010
They got behind us.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.390
Lady Farnese?

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:20.130
<i>Casca!</i>

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.250
You all go!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.810
I can hold here alone.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.020
You protect the women and those inside!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.700
Understood! You handle the rest!

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:32.220
Damn, leave some for me!

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:39.980
Idiots, out of the way!

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.150
Hey, did you see that?

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.420
He leaped... No, flew over us.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.420
Well done, my wind army.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.470
Why don't you guys try pitching in?

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:04.430
Isidoro, can you handle 
things here for a while?

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:03.740
See you!

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:06.820
Accept it!

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:08.180
You must not fear!

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:09.930
Casca!

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:20.680
Fools...

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.070
Schierke!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:26.420
Oh, God... Take me to thy bosom.

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.710
That was the last strike.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.340
They just keep coming...

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.210
What's Schierke doing?

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:41.480
Guess I'm outta options.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.440
But with your skills, I gotta say...

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:45.970
Idiot! This is where it counts!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:52.120
<i>Shit. The sword's thrown 
me off-balance.</i>

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:53.620
<i>You've gotta be kidding.</i>

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:54.560
<i>Will I die here?</i>

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:00.320
Gramps!

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.820
Morgan!

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:04.850
Hey, you guys!

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:07.550
Don't leave it to the kids and elderly!

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:08.390
That's right!

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:09.490
Damn it!

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:13.160
Gramps, hey!

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:19.420
From the void I call thee, four kings 
of land, sea, sky and fire.

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:22.020
Shield us in this circle.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:25.430
Light the flame to warm, 
protect, and guard us.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:29.540
Ward us from all harm.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:34.640
I call upon thee, the four sacred kings, 
to come forth and protect us.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:49.070
Lady Farnese!

00:22:05.780 --> 00:22:08.180
The trolls are crumbling...

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:10.100
What is this light?

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:15.100
His wound's healing!

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:17.350
He'll live!

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:21.390
<i>This is... her magic?</i>

00:23:56.990 --> 00:24:00.910
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.420
<b>Is this punishment or...</b>

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:09.760
<b>I am wielding a blade for 
another's protection...</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>Fine! Come at me, you mad apes!</b>

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:17.810
<b>Guess I'll go for a hundred 
consecutive kills.</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>I missed you, boy. 
It's been a while.</b>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:27.410
<b><i>Next Time 
The Arcana of Invocation</i></b>
